      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّبَالِى</span></b>  [inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَالَى</span>]: see 1. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبالى القَوْمُ</span>
<i>The people,</i> or <i>company of men, vied,</i> or <i>strove,
one with another, in hastening to a little water,
and drew from it.</i> (Msb.)

